#
# Architecture-neutral facade for raw syscall invocation. The actual instruction
# sequence and register ABI live in the per-architecture syscall module, selected
# automatically by the compiler's "native" arch token. This module simply
# re-exports syscall0..6 so existing imports of uranite.os.syscall.invoke keep
# working unchanged across x86-64, aarch64, and future targets.
#
